OL,3,APoundland set for more time to secure a
OL,4,Arescue deal as emergency talks continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland and its 11,000 employees are
OL,7,Fhopeful that the retailer's impending
OL,8,Fcollapse can be delayed to allow time
OL,9,Ffor a last-minute rescue deal.
OL,11,FThe discount chain has been edging
OL,12,Ftowards administration after being
OL,13,Fblocked by its owners from accessing
OL,14,Fcash in its bank accounts.
OL,16,FA deadline to secure a buyer for the
OL,17,Fbusiness is set to expire at midnight,
OL,18,Fbut sources close to the situation have
OL,19,Ftold the BBC that they expect more time
OL,20,Fwill be given, thanks to the release of
OL,21,F#10m in funding.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
