OL,3,APoundland set for more time to secure a
OL,4,Arescue deal as emergency talks continue
OL,5,
OL,6,FA committee of MPs is set to question
OL,7,FGordon Brothers, Poundland's US owners,
OL,8,Fon Wednesday following accusations that
OL,9,Fthe investment firm hopes to profit
OL,10,Ffrom selling off Poundland's 600 stores
OL,11,Fand stock piecemeal.
